    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1668341200\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/2208a9e3512e3ed0d50ae94cf9a28912.avif?t=1668341200\" /></div><br><br>Shadow Racer is a third-person driving adventure game where the player controls the Shadow Rider, a car built by the resistance able to eliminate the darkness of the empire. In a post-apocalyptic future, the world has been corrupted by the darkness. The only place in the world that remains free from the control of the dark empire is The Grand Canyon. <br><br>Master the four-car elements: Drifting! Flashing! Boosting! Bumping!  Save the valley by exploring a cursed world, filled with battles, secrets, amazing characters, and exciting racing challenges against the best racers in the land. Will you be worthy of being the new shadow racer?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1668341200\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Racing mechanics mixed with exciting combat <br></li><li>A world full of secrets to uncover <br></li><li>Scenic landscapes <br></li><li>Languages: English, Spanish, Basque</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/c6a8030dc57b6658d87a1d47a5be09de.poster.avif?t=1668341200\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/c6a8030dc57b6658d87a1d47a5be09de.webm?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/c6a8030dc57b6658d87a1d47a5be09de.mp4?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/24e866f792a459b8e607bb2f2fe3febb.poster.avif?t=1668341200\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/24e866f792a459b8e607bb2f2fe3febb.webm?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/24e866f792a459b8e607bb2f2fe3febb.mp4?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/859ef6909d5e8bf0173b71b5db7c95ca.poster.avif?t=1668341200\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/859ef6909d5e8bf0173b71b5db7c95ca.webm?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/859ef6909d5e8bf0173b71b5db7c95ca.mp4?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1668341200\" /></div><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology Europe - Bilbao and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/478cde067210d26cdd6545c101965ce1.avif?t=1668341200\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1668341200\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/2208a9e3512e3ed0d50ae94cf9a28912.avif?t=1668341200\" /></div><br><br>Shadow Racer is a third-person driving adventure game where the player controls the Shadow Rider, a car built by the resistance able to eliminate the darkness of the empire. In a post-apocalyptic future, the world has been corrupted by the darkness. The only place in the world that remains free from the control of the dark empire is The Grand Canyon. <br><br>Master the four-car elements: Drifting! Flashing! Boosting! Bumping!  Save the valley by exploring a cursed world, filled with battles, secrets, amazing characters, and exciting racing challenges against the best racers in the land. Will you be worthy of being the new shadow racer?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1668341200\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Racing mechanics mixed with exciting combat <br></li><li>A world full of secrets to uncover <br></li><li>Scenic landscapes <br></li><li>Languages: English, Spanish, Basque</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/c6a8030dc57b6658d87a1d47a5be09de.poster.avif?t=1668341200\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/c6a8030dc57b6658d87a1d47a5be09de.webm?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/c6a8030dc57b6658d87a1d47a5be09de.mp4?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/24e866f792a459b8e607bb2f2fe3febb.poster.avif?t=1668341200\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/24e866f792a459b8e607bb2f2fe3febb.webm?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/24e866f792a459b8e607bb2f2fe3febb.mp4?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/859ef6909d5e8bf0173b71b5db7c95ca.poster.avif?t=1668341200\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/859ef6909d5e8bf0173b71b5db7c95ca.webm?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/859ef6909d5e8bf0173b71b5db7c95ca.mp4?t=1668341200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1668341200\" /></div><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology Europe - Bilbao and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981300/extras/478cde067210d26cdd6545c101965ce1.avif?t=1668341200\" /></div>",
